reagent-name-nutricryokomp = nutricryokomp
reagent-desc-nutricryokomp = A cryogenic compound that quickly replenishes nutrient deficiencies, reduces metabolic stress, and provides energy. Works on both the dead and the living.

reagent-name-darvinium = darvinium
reagent-desc-darvinium = A drug capable of accelerating the genome development of almost any lower creature, transforming it into a humanoid.

reagent-name-universal-solvent = universal solvent
reagent-desc-universal-solvent = A powerful cleaning agent banned in most places due to safety concerns. Exceptionally effective at dissolving skin, scales, and down. Visually identical to regular space cleaner.

reagent-name-h-32 = h-32
reagent-desc-h-32 = A cryogenic compound developed in high-radiation field conditions. Works on both the dead and the living.

reagent-name-antidon = antidon
reagent-desc-antidon = A specialized cryogenic reagent for treating poisoning, effectively neutralizing toxic damage. Works on both the dead and the living.

reagent-name-brutedon = brutedon
reagent-desc-brutedon = An advanced cryogenic agent for treating mechanical damage, healing all types of physical trauma. Works on both the dead and the living.

reagent-name-celliminol = celliminol
reagent-desc-celliminol = A cryogenic-grade chemical. A powerful compound developed by a corporation. Works on both the dead and the living.

reagent-name-hemostatic-powder = hemostatic powder
reagent-desc-hemostatic-powder = Hemostatic powder based on a mixture of tranexamic acid and iron silicide. Overdose severely poisons the body with toxins.

reagent-name-artiplasm = artiplasm
reagent-desc-artiplasm = Advanced blood substitute based on synthetic plasmoid particles. Quickly restores blood volume and stops bleeding. Accumulation over 11 units causes uncontrolled internal vessel ruptures.

reagent-name-genocillin = genocillin
reagent-desc-genocillin = Experimental gene inhibitor repairs cellular damage and weakly treats exhaustion. Overdose causes chaotic internal bleeding.

reagent-name-thyreostate = thyreostate
reagent-desc-thyreostate = Synthetic metabolic depressant. Seriously treats asphyxiation but slows movement. Overdose over 15 units causes respiratory paralysis.

reagent-name-salicylicacid = salicylic acid
reagent-desc-salicylicacid = Powerful healing agent that restores bruises, cuts, and punctures. Effective against extensive mechanical damage, but cannot heal people with weaker injuries due to the nature of its work.

reagent-name-oxanderm = oxanderm
reagent-desc-oxanderm = Powerful healing agent that restores bruises, cuts, and punctures. Effective against extensive physical damage, including acid damage, but cannot heal people with weaker injuries due to the nature of its work.
